    "blocks": [
      {"id": "title", "type": "markdown", "body": "# Paper-1 ESC 双真人参考审计"},
      {"id": "summary", "type": "markdown", "sourceId": "human_reference_freeze", "body": "## 技术结论\n\n两份 24-item 独立盲评均完整可用，不需要重评。Overall QWK 为 **0.7571**、Spearman 为 **0.8007**，仅 **1/24** 项出现至少 2 分的 Overall 分歧；该项已在保持盲性的条件下裁决为 **4**。任何 evaluator 必须同时对两人报告 agreement。"},
      {"id": "mapping", "type": "markdown", "sourceId": "dual_reference_json", "body": "## 标签错误已机械修复，原始判断没有被改写\n\n历史 v1 instrument 将 Humanoid 与 Skillful rubric 对调。normalized artifacts 只执行 `v1 Skillful -> official Humanoid` 与 `v1 Humanoid -> official Skillful`，旧 instrument 和原始提交保持不可变。"},
      {"id": "agreement_intro", "type": "markdown", "body": "## 总体排序稳定，维度绝对分数仍含视角差异\n\nQWK 和 Spearman 表明两位 reviewer 对相对好坏有较强一致性；完全同分率较低则说明评分尺度与关注角度不同。分歧应作为 sensitivity 保留，而不是把其中一人事后指定为唯一标准。"},
      {"id": "qwk_chart", "type": "chart", "chartId": "qwk_by_dimension", "layout": "full"},
      {"id": "agreement", "type": "table", "tableId": "agreement_table", "layout": "full"},
      {"id": "scope", "type": "markdown", "sourceId": "qualification_results", "body": "## 测量对象与边界\n\n本数据粒度是 blind item × official ESC-Eval dimension × reviewer。它用于资格审查自动 evaluator，不是 PM/Top-k outcome，也不证明临床效果。质量 reviewer 不需要知道资源身份；资源执行情况由独立 uptake review 处理。"},
      {"id": "method", "type": "markdown", "body": "## 方法\n\n两份 submission 先验证 24 个 opaque ID 完整、唯一、0-4整数有效且 `human_completed=true`，随后只做冻结的两列名称归位。报告逐维 QWK、Spearman、MAD、完全同分率及绝对分差至少2分的项目数。"},
      {"id": "limitations", "type": "markdown", "sourceId": "dual_reference_json", "body": "## 局限与稳健性\n\ncontrolled verbosity variants 同时增加支持性 framing，不能识别纯长度偏好；one-turn controlled probes 也不能替代多轮 natural-dialogue evidence。targeted adjudication 只解决唯一 major-Overall 格，不构造完整单一 gold；其他分歧继续作为 sensitivity。"},
      {"id": "next", "type": "markdown", "sourceId": "qualification_results", "body": "## 下一步\n\n当前 24-item reference 不再需要人评。下一步是在 >=24 GiB GPU 上跑 pinned ESC-RANK，并在 exact model identity 冻结后运行 proxy judges；所有 outcome lock 继续 CLOSED。"},
      {"id": "questions", "type": "markdown", "body": "## 尚待决定\n\n仍需冻结 Qwen、DeepSeek 与第四独立家族 judge 的 exact model/version，并完成 ESC-RANK runtime qualification；不能依据哪个 judge 让 PM/Ours 分高来选择。"}
    ]
